<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Vital Signs lowered.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Vital Signs lowered.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>UBS Securities said analyst Samuel Navarro downgraded Vital Signs Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- cited &quot;uncertainty of the company's revenue and EPS growth.&quot;</p>
<p>-- lowered fiscal 1997 earnings estimate to $1.44 a share from $1.53, cut fiscal 1998 to $1.55 from $1.86.</p>
</text>
